        <item>The whisk needs room to turn. Give it some.</item>
        <item>Empty space isn\'t wasted — that\'s where the mixing happens.</item>
        <item>A bucket filled to the top is a bucket on the floor.</item>
        <item>Room at the top, or dust everywhere.</item>
        <item>If it looks full before you start, it\'s already too late.</item>
        <item>Mix needs headroom. So do you.</item>
